  !>           \p bsrColIndA, \p info, or \p pBufferSizeInBytes is nullptr, \p mb, or \p nnzb is
  !>           negative,
  !>           or \p blockDim is invalid.
  !>   \retval HIPSPARSE_STATUS_INTERNAL_ERROR an internal error occurred.
