  !>
  !>   \details
  !>   Specifically given an input dense column-ordered matrix A, with leading dimension \p lda,
  !>   where \p lda>=m,
  !>   the resulting pruned sparse CSR matrix C is computed using:
  !>   \f[
  !>    |C(i,j)| = A(i, j) \text{  if |A(i, j)| > threshold}
  !>   \f]
